---
layout: layouts/page.njk
basePath: /faq/
title: FAQ
heading: Frequently asked questions
standfirst: The questions no other page answers. Everything else is linked from here.
description: Frequently asked questions about the Kenya-China Tea Summit 2027 in Nairobi — dates, registration, fees, venue, speakers, exhibition and travel.
---

{# One array feeds both the visible list and the FAQPage JSON-LD, so the two
   cannot disagree. Answers may carry inline links: schema.org permits anchors
   in acceptedAnswer.text, and an FAQ that says "the Venue page" without linking
   to it is the one page where that failure is most annoying. Rendered with
   `| safe` below; `| dump` escapes them correctly for the JSON-LD. #}
{% set faqs = [
  { cat: "The basics", q: "When and where is the summit?", a: "21 to 23 April 2027, at the Kenyatta International Convention Centre in Nairobi. See the <a href=\"/venue/\">venue page</a>." },
  { cat: "The basics", q: "Who organises the summit?", a: "Orbitline Events &amp; Ushers Ltd, in partnership with the Tea Board of Kenya." },
  { cat: "The basics", q: "What language is the summit in?", a: "This website is published in English and Chinese. Interpretation arrangements at the summit are to be announced." },
  { cat: "Registering", q: "How much does it cost to attend?", a: "Fees are to be announced. Registering your interest now carries no charge." },
  { cat: "Registering", q: "Can an organisation exhibit and attend as a delegate?", a: "Yes. Tick Exhibitor at registration, and select the category that describes the organisation. They are separate questions." },
  { cat: "Registering", q: "What happens after I register?", a: "Registration confirms by email. When the delegate portal opens you sign in with that address to update details, book a stand, request B2B meetings and download documents." },
  { cat: "The expo", q: "Is the expo on all three days?", a: "The International Tea &amp; Technology Expo runs on Day 3, Friday 23 April, in a tent on the KICC grounds." },
  { cat: "The expo", q: "How many stands are there?", a: "146 across two halls. Sizes and rates are to be announced, and the layout is subject to change before stands go on sale. See <a href=\"/exhibition/stands/\">stands and rates</a>." },
  { cat: "The expo", q: "When does stand booking open?", a: "Once rates are confirmed. Register as an exhibitor and the Secretariat makes contact. Booking happens in the exhibitor portal, where exhibitors select a stand from a plan and hold it while the Secretariat confirms." },
  { cat: "Getting here", q: "Does Kenya require a visa?", a: "Most visitors need an Electronic Travel Authorisation before departure. Apply at <a href=\"https://www.etakenya.go.ke/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">etakenya.go.ke</a> and confirm with the Kenyan embassy covering the country of departure. See <a href=\"/travel/\">travel and visas</a>." },
  { cat: "Getting here", q: "Are invitation letters available?", a: "Yes. Register, then email <a href=\"mailto:support@kenyachinateasummit.com\">support@kenyachinateasummit.com</a> with passport details and organisation." },
  { cat: "Getting here", q: "Is there a summit hotel block?", a: "Hotel rates and booking codes are to be announced." },
  { cat: "Programme", q: "Who is speaking?", a: "Speakers are announced in phases. See the <a href=\"/programme/\">programme</a>." },
  { cat: "Practical", q: "How do I reach a person?", a: "Call or WhatsApp +254 111 491 076, or email <a href=\"mailto:info@kenyachinateasummit.com\">info@kenyachinateasummit.com</a>." },
  { cat: "Practical", q: "How is my data handled?", a: "The site sets no cookies and runs no third-party trackers. See the <a href=\"/privacy/\">privacy notice</a>." }
] %}

{% block head %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {% for item in faqs %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": {{ item.q | dump | safe }},
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ item.a | dump | safe }} }
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
{% endblock %}

{% for item in faqs %}
{% if loop.first or item.cat != faqs[loop.index0 - 1].cat %}
<h2>{{ item.cat }}</h2>
{% endif %}
<h3>{{ item.q }}</h3>
<p>{{ item.a | safe }}</p>
{% endfor %}

{% from "components/image-grid.njk" import grid %}
<aside class="rail">
  {{ grid([
    {src:"/img/plates/tea-canopy-plucking-table", alt:"The even canopy of a tea plucking table, with planted slopes rising behind it."}
  ], "", "", "(min-width: 64rem) 300px, 100vw") }}
  <div class="rail__card">
    <p class="label">Still have a question</p>
    <p>Anything this page does not answer, ask the summit team directly.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact/">Contact the summit team</a></p>
  </div>
</aside>
